Package: glibc-nodejs
Version: 26.12.1-1
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: glibc-repo
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc, curl, tar, xz-utils, bash, coreutils, ca-certificates
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://nodejs.org/
Description: Node.js runtime with glibc for Termux
 Isolated Node.js runtime built for glibc, installed without replacing
 the Termux system Node.js. Node.js 26.12.1 for ARM64 or x86_64 is
 downloaded from the official release and verified with a pinned
 SHA-256 checksum.
